   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "camping.ctx6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then let's make it work. A big tarp rigged over the picnic table, or switching to one of their little cabins?",
